      "side": 1,
      "message": "i think it would be best to avoid the `LINT.IfChange` mindset here. try to keep the coupling loose so that we can tolerate some version skew (so things are potentially less painful if we end up having to backport changes on either side)",
      "parentUuid": "8c283d9e_e08ddf02",
