      },
      "lineNbr": 109,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-10T05:52:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "in this function, yes, but inside of crosvm, the lifecycle of the slice is during one frame. (1) obtain a new slice, (2) draw something on it, and then (3) send the slice back to the display system. See the blow block.\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:external/crosvm/devices/src/virtio/gpu/virtio_gpu.rs;l\u003d380-387?q\u003df:virtio_gpu.rs\u0026ss\u003dandroid%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain",
      "parentUuid": "f91135fb_18c202e8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 108,
        "startChar": 88,
        "endLine": 109,
        "endChar": 72
      },
      "revId": "9bf13cf253ffbf954ca9369a4b69ef1d50a47152",
